' Aus test_div_and_float_display.py uebertragen (6 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-08). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== division unchanged
PRINT 8 / 2
PRINT 9 / 2
PRINT 6 / 3
--- erwartet
4
4.5
2

=== float into integer hints backslash
DIM x AS INTEGER
x = 9 / 2
--- fehler
Zuweisung an global: FLOAT 4.5 passt nicht verlustfrei in INTEGER -- fuer ganzzahlige Division \ statt / nehmen, sonst mit INT()/ROUND() runden

=== backslash is the fix
DIM x AS INTEGER
x = 9 \ 2
PRINT x
--- erwartet
4

=== general float display unchanged
PRINT 0.1 + 0.2
--- erwartet ungefaehr
0.30000000000000004

=== audio bus volume rounded
IMPORT "audio"
AUDIO_BUS_VOLUME("music", 0.8)
PRINT AUDIO_BUS_GET_VOLUME("music")
--- erwartet
0.8

=== audio channel volume rounded
IMPORT "audio"
DIM s AS SOUND
s = AUDIO_TONE(440.0, 100, "sine", 0.5)
DIM ch AS INTEGER
ch = AUDIO_PLAY(s)
AUDIO_SET_VOLUME(ch, 0.35)
PRINT AUDIO_GET_VOLUME(ch)
--- erwartet
0.35

